[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……と、いうわけで。\n恥ずかしながら帰ってまいりました",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...And so. Embarrassing as it is to admit, I've come back."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "わーい！\u3000やったーーーっ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yay! She's back!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ぬぬぬ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ugh..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヨハナ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私の涙、返しなさいよーーーーっ！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Give me back my tears!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うう……お騒がせしてすまない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ugh... I'm sorry for putting you all through that."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ともあれ、これで元通りですわね。\n幸い、まだ外部には情報を出していませんし",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, all is as it should be. Fortunately, nothing got out to the public."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "社長殿。またお世話になりまする",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm in your care once again, Miss President."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ。今年はさらに忙しくなりますわよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Indeed. This year is only going to get busier, you know."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "精一杯頑張らせていただきまする！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I will give it everything I've got!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "家のことが忙しいからってサボらないでよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And don't go slacking off just because your clan duties keep you busy!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "当然！\u3000両立すると決めたのだからな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Of course not! I decided to do both, and I intend to."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そういえば。来週にはこの学園も新学期がスタート。\nこの教室が使えるのもあと数日ですわね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "On another note—the new term at this school starts next week. We only have a few more days with this classroom."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "え！\u3000じゃあ練習場所はどうすれば……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh! So where are we going to practice then...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふ。ご安心なさいな。近日、\nララ・プロダクションの新スタジオが完成しますわ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe. Not to worry. Lara Productions' new studio will be completed very soon!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なんと！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Truly?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "今後は我が社もアイドル路線に力を入れていくつもり\nですので、そのための投資ですわね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We intend to put more of our efforts into the idol side of things going forward. Consider it an investment."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アタシたち、先輩になるかもしれないんだ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We might actually become senpais to someone!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どんな後輩が入ってくるか楽しみね。\n……ま、私レベルの奴はそうそういないでしょうけど",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm curious what kind of juniors we'll get. ...Though I doubt any of them will be at my level."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "拙者たちも負けていられませんな！\n早速レッスンといこう！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "All the more reason we cannot fall behind! Let's get to practice!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おーー！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
